WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.370
No peacocking!

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:04.547
Oliver Putnam in the houssseee!

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.180
Hey, when we get there, how do you want to
handle the entrances? Maybe you introduce me-

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:10.670
Introduce?

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:11.540
-come in.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.140
This is a table read. Charles. It's
not the Donna Reed Show.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:15.590
Donna Reed was-

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:16.400
Not worth it.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:16.570
Okay.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:20.240
Now, please do not start this
journey by alienating all of your colleagues

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.430
with some desperate attempt at peacocking.

